{"id":"d52200471f6d9a02","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-measure9-markov-kernel-composition.md","title":"ZFC Measure9 Markov Kernel Composition","display":"df-zfc-measure9-markov-kernel-composition — ZFC Measure9 Markov Kernel Composition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure9-markov-kernel-composition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure9-markov-kernel-composition"],"display":"df-zfc-measure9-markov-kernel-composition — ZFC Measure9 Markov Kernel Composition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure9-markov-kernel-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-markov-kernel-composition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure9-markov-kernel-composition — ZFC Measure9 Markov Kernel Composition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b11853a4f3d4652b\" href=\"?note=b11853a4f3d4652b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel\">58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J,K,L,X,Y,Z,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y,\\mathcal Z,\\ell_C\\in V\">\\(J,K,L,X,Y,Z,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y,\\mathcal Z,\\ell_C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b11853a4f3d4652b\" href=\"?note=b11853a4f3d4652b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel\">58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MarkovKernelComposition}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MarkovKernelComposition}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}markov\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}composition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MarkovKernelComposition}_S(J,K,L,X,Y,Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y,\\mathcal Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(K,X,\\mathcal X,Y,\\mathcal Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(L,Y,\\mathcal Y,Z,\\mathcal Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(J,X,\\mathcal X,Z,\\mathcal Z)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall C\\in\\mathcal Z\\;\\exists\\ell_C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\ell_C=\\{\\langle y,L(y)(C)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15em}\\land J(x)(C)=\\int_Y\\ell_C\\,dK(x)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}markov\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}composition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MarkovKernelComposition}_S(J,K,L,X,Y,Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y,\\mathcal Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(K,X,\\mathcal X,Y,\\mathcal Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(L,Y,\\mathcal Y,Z,\\mathcal Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(J,X,\\mathcal X,Z,\\mathcal Z)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall C\\in\\mathcal Z\\;\\exists\\ell_C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\ell_C=\\{\\langle y,L(y)(C)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15em}\\land J(x)(C)=\\int_Y\\ell_C\\,dK(x)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A kernel is sourced as a function whose value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(x)\">\\(K(x)\\)</span> is itself a probability-measure function.  Hence evaluation is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(x)(E)\">\\(K(x)(E)\\)</span>, not an unregistered binary application <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(x,E)\">\\(K(x,E)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The integrand graph <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_C:y\\mapsto L(y)(C)\">\\(\\ell_C:y\\mapsto L(y)(C)\\)</span> and the measure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(x)\">\\(K(x)\\)</span> are explicit set objects satisfying the interface required by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel","status":"resolved","id":"b11853a4f3d4652b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel","status":"resolved","id":"b11853a4f3d4652b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-prob2-markov-kernel]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The integrand graph $\\ell_C:y\\mapsto L(y)(C)$ and the measure $K(x)$ are explicit set objects satisfying the interface required by [[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J,K,L,X,Y,Z,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y,\\mathcal Z,\\ell_C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MarkovKernelComposition}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}markov\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}composition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9MarkovKernelComposition}_S(J,K,L,X,Y,Z)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y,\\mathcal Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(K,X,\\mathcal X,Y,\\mathcal Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(L,Y,\\mathcal Y,Z,\\mathcal Z)\\\\\n&\\hspace{7em}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2MarkovKernel}_S(J,X,\\mathcal X,Z,\\mathcal Z)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall C\\in\\mathcal Z\\;\\exists\\ell_C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\ell_C=\\{\\langle y,L(y)(C)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{15em}\\land J(x)(C)=\\int_Y\\ell_C\\,dK(x)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"K(x)","display":false},{"tex":"K(x)(E)","display":false},{"tex":"K(x,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_C:y\\mapsto L(y)(C)","display":false},{"tex":"K(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1756,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2675","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure9-markov-kernel-composition.md|58-df-zfc-measure9-markov-kernel-composition]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3